00:22:50,560 --> 00:22:51,981
[SPEAKER_00]: Everybody didn't have lights in those days.

470
00:22:52,361 --> 00:22:53,502
[SPEAKER_00]: Did Dykes have a bed check?

471
00:22:54,203 --> 00:22:55,684
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, you had a bed check at twelve o'clock.

472
00:22:56,104 --> 00:22:59,207
[SPEAKER_00]: At two o'clock at night game, you played knifeball, you know.

473
00:23:00,048 --> 00:23:00,888
[SPEAKER_00]: You played two o'clock.

474
00:23:02,169 --> 00:23:02,590
[SPEAKER_00]: I remember

475
00:23:04,206 --> 00:23:08,849
