00:23:54,913 --> 00:23:55,654
[SPEAKER_00]: He was a big boy.

492
00:23:55,714 --> 00:23:57,055
[SPEAKER_00]: Sammy West.

493
00:23:57,075 --> 00:23:59,296
[SPEAKER_00]: We had a boy out of Chicago.

494
00:23:59,356 --> 00:24:00,377
[SPEAKER_00]: I can't recall his name.

495
00:24:01,057 --> 00:24:02,318
[SPEAKER_00]: We had a great big sign in

496
00:24:02,951 --> 00:24:06,993
[SPEAKER_00]: Wright Field and Swartzman-Spark, and he wasn't too graceful as an outfielder.

497
00:24:07,894 --> 00:24:16,518
[SPEAKER_00]: And the Yankees had the bases full, and out of your color, you hit a dick, you somehow hit a fly ball, and he charged in on it, and he overran it, and he started backing up.

498
00:24:16,538 --> 00:24:18,219
[SPEAKER_00]: He was backing up faster than he was coming in.

499
00:24:18,960 --> 00:24:22,461
[SPEAKER_00]: And on that sign, Wright Field, it was a schick sign, a man was shaving his face, you know?

500
00:24:23,922 --> 00:24:27,564
[SPEAKER_00]: And he hit, you could hear it all over the ballpark when he backed into that wall, see?

501
00:24:28,945 --> 00:24:31,086
[SPEAKER_00]: So the ball, that's the first time I ever seen Hornsby laugh.

502
00:24:31,503 --> 00:24:35,026
[SPEAKER_00]: with their bases full, two outs, everybody's running.

503
00:24:35,046 --> 00:24:44,153
[SPEAKER_00]: So he didn't get the ball, had the ball come back to the infield, and he come in, he got the ball, he's throwing the base runner out at third base, he threw the ball on a flyer into the dugout where Harvey was sitting.

504
00:24:45,034 --> 00:24:50,778
[SPEAKER_00]: Husband took off, you know, he went in the tunnel down there, and he come back out laughing.

505
00:24:51,139 --> 00:24:53,901
[SPEAKER_00]: He said, what the hell, what's gonna happen next, you know?

506
00:24:55,342 --> 00:24:59,425
[SPEAKER_00]: And after we got the side out, we talked to Bruce, Bruce Camp, Bruce Camp.

507
00:25:00,512 --> 00:25:02,934
