508
00:25:03,295 --> 00:25:07,618
[SPEAKER_00]: Something happened to his body and he come back, he was voted the most clear of the year.

509
00:25:07,719 --> 00:25:08,159
[SPEAKER_00]: That's right.

510
00:25:08,719 --> 00:25:11,042
[SPEAKER_00]: But anyway, he asked Bruce, do you hurt yourself?

511
00:25:11,062 --> 00:25:11,962
[SPEAKER_00]: He said, no, I don't think so.

512
00:25:11,982 --> 00:25:16,567
[SPEAKER_00]: He took his cap off and run his hand through his hair, come up with a handful of blood.

513
00:25:17,207 --> 00:25:18,789
[SPEAKER_00]: He said, I'll be a son of a gun.

514
00:25:18,809 --> 00:25:20,330
