515
00:25:21,331 --> 00:25:24,854
[SPEAKER_00]: Just like that.

516
00:25:24,994 --> 00:25:26,976
[SPEAKER_01]: That's Bruce Campbell said that.

517
00:25:27,461 --> 00:25:29,163
[SPEAKER_00]: Those are the things you can't forget, you know.

518
00:25:29,623 --> 00:25:31,064
[SPEAKER_00]: What was the funniest thing ever?

519
00:25:31,104 --> 00:25:32,506
[SPEAKER_00]: Was that ranked among them?

520
00:25:32,526 --> 00:25:33,406
[SPEAKER_00]: That would be one of them.

521
00:25:33,607 --> 00:25:39,492
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, it's funny, you know, when you're stealing third base, when a man on third base is very funny, but it's funny when you get up there and look at it.

522
00:25:41,193 --> 00:25:41,914
[SPEAKER_00]: I did that once.

523
00:25:41,994 --> 00:25:42,675
[SPEAKER_00]: I did that once.

524
00:25:42,695 --> 00:25:43,896
[SPEAKER_00]: I've seen it happen several times.

525
00:25:44,737 --> 00:25:45,517
[SPEAKER_00]: And I've seen...

526
00:25:46,298 --> 00:25:49,100
[SPEAKER_00]: Describe this again.

527
00:25:49,461 --> 00:25:54,065
[SPEAKER_00]: When you're on second base, you hit the ground ball, and he's on second base.

528
00:25:54,737 --> 00:26:02,099
[SPEAKER_00]: And maybe the shortstop at third base, whoever feels the ball throws it away at first, you go from home plate all the way to second, then he goes from second base to third base.

