00:27:15,753 --> 00:27:16,474
[SPEAKER_00]: Bo Bell was one.

550
00:27:17,498 --> 00:27:21,140
[SPEAKER_00]: And Tony, I don't know what his name was, I can't recall, but they was playing for Galveston.

